---
export const prerender = true;
import "../styles/tokens.css";
import "../styles/reset.css";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <meta name="description" content="Motto Immortal Database has been permanently taken offline following a copyright objection from the game's publisher." />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
  <title>Motto Immortal Database is closed</title>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="closed">
    <p class="eyebrow">Notice of closure</p>
    <h1>Motto Immortal Database<br />has closed permanently.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      This site is no longer available and will not be operated any further.
    </p>

    <div class="body">
      <p>
        The publisher of Motto Immortal raised a copyright objection against this
        fan project. Out of respect for their rights, I have decided to withdraw
        the site completely rather than continue in a way that could cause
        problems for anyone.
      </p>
      <p>
        All content, tools and guides have been taken offline, and nothing will be
        restored or moved elsewhere.
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <p class="thanks">
      Motto Immortal Database was a solo, non-commercial passion project. Thank
      you to everyone who visited, shared feedback, reported mistakes and helped
      the community along the way. It meant a great deal.
    </p>
    <p class="note">
      This was an unofficial fan project and was never affiliated with, endorsed
      by, or sponsored by the game's developer or publisher. All game names,
      artwork and trademarks belong to their respective owners.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px 20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 0%, var(--accent-purple-dim), transparent 70%),
      var(--bg-base);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .closed {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }

  .closed h1 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .lead {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-bright);
  }

  .body {
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .closed hr {
    margin: 36px 0 28px;
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .thanks {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
